  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">BRA/24/G76 - HCFC Phase Out Management Plan Stage III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">BRA/24/G76 - Project for the Service Sector: Recovery, Recycling and Regeneration (R&amp;R&amp;R) and Technical Assistance for the Commercial and Industrial Air Conditioning Sector (AC/CI) will continue the work being carried out under Stages I and II of the Brazilian HCFC Phase-out Management Plan by implementing activities that will result in the elimination of the consumption of 191.09 tons of Ozone Depleting Potential (ODP) by 2030, as well as supporting the Brazilian Government in the implementation of Stage III of the HPMP.</narrative>
  </description>
